X Y Z     // city names
3         // number of routes
X Y 6     // route from X to Y takes 6 min
X Z 10    // route from X to Z takes 10 min
Y Z 2     // route from Y to Z takes 2 min
X Z       // find fastest route from X to Z

```
## 📥 Sample Output (output.txt)
