This repository contains the `SellerDroid` Android project and an ASP.NET MVC application located in `SellerDroidSolution/SellerDroidWeb`.

## Running the Web Application

The original project shipped with a Windows-only `web.bat` script that started IIS Express. The new cross-platform script `run_web.sh` allows the application to be built using the `dotnet` CLI and run via IIS Express on Windows or using the Mono `xsp4` server on Linux/macOS.

### Prerequisites

- [.NET SDK](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download) (provides the `dotnet` CLI)
- **Windows:** [IIS Express](https://www.iis.net/downloads/microsoft/iis-express)
- **Linux/macOS:** [Mono](https://www.mono-project.com/) with the `xsp4` package

### Usage

```bash
cd SellerDroidSolution
./run_web.sh
```

The script will build the `SellerDroidWeb` project. On Windows it launches IIS Express on port 5000. On Linux/macOS it starts `xsp4` on the same port.

Open your browser to `http://localhost:5000` to view the site."
