- Update for Minecraft 1.21.5",production_grade,"The project is a standalone mod for fabric that reimplements MCPatcher's CIT features, distributed through popular mod repositories like Modrinth and Curse Forge, with an API for development and usage documentation. It is actively maintained and suitable for real-world use in Minecraft modding.",9,"<p align=""center"">
