Get started with GoodMem in seconds with our one-line installer:

```bash
curl -s https://get.goodmem.ai | bash
```

This installs and starts the GoodMem server, CLI, and database locally with interactive mode selection.

### Installation Modes

Choose between **Production** and **Debug** modes based on your needs:

#### Interactive Installation (Default)
The installer will prompt you to choose between production and debug mode:

```bash
curl -s https://get.goodmem.ai | bash
```

#### Unattended Production Installation
For servers and CI/CD pipelines where you want maximum security:

```bash
curl -s https://get.goodmem.ai | bash -s -- --prod-install --local-db --no-openai-embedder-registration
```

- Database port is **not exposed** externally (secure)
- Uses local PostgreSQL container (no external database needed)
- Skips interactive prompts for database selection and OpenAI setup
- Perfect for production deployments and CI/CD pipelines

#### Unattended Debug Installation  
For development environments where you need database access:

```bash
curl -s https://get.goodmem.ai | bash -s -- --debug-install
```

- Database port **exposed** on `localhost:5432` (convenient for development)
- You can still skip OpenAI setup with `--no-openai-embedder-registration`

### Installation Options

| Flag | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `--prod-install` | Production mode (database port not exposed) |
| `--debug-install` | Debug mode (database port exposed on 5432) |
| `--local-db` | Use local PostgreSQL database (skips database selection prompt) |
| `--remote-db` | Use remote PostgreSQL database (see installer README for connection flags) |
| `--no-openai-embedder-registration` | Skip OpenAI embedder setup (unattended mode) |
| `--help` | Show help documentation |

### What Gets Installed

The installer automatically:
- ✅ Detects your platform (Linux/macOS/Windows, AMD64/ARM64)
- ✅ Installs Docker (Linux) or provides instructions (macOS/Windows)
- ✅ Downloads GoodMem server and database containers (or connects to remote database)
- ✅ Installs the GoodMem CLI binary
- ✅ Initializes the database and creates root API key
- ✅ Optionally sets up OpenAI embedder for immediate use

**Database Options:**
- **Local (Default)**: PostgreSQL container deployed alongside GoodMem server
- **Remote**: Connect to existing PostgreSQL instance (NeonDB, AWS RDS, GCP Cloud SQL, etc.)
- See [installer/README.md](installer/README.md) for remote database configuration options

### Access Points After Installation

**Production Mode:**
- REST API: `http://localhost:8080`
- gRPC API: `localhost:9090`
- Database: Internal only (secure)
- Health probes: `/livez`, `/readyz`, `/startupz` (unauthenticated)

**Debug Mode:**
- REST API: `http://localhost:8080`
- gRPC API: `localhost:9090`
- Database: `localhost:5432` (accessible for development)
- Health probes: `/livez`, `/readyz`, `/startupz` (unauthenticated)

