Installing Node.js using nodebrew:

```
$ curl -L git.io/nodebrew | perl - setup
$ echo 'export PATH=$HOME/.nodebrew/current/bin:$PATH' >> ~/.bashrc
$ source ~/.bashrc
$ nodebrew install-binary v12.x
$ nodebrew use v12.x
```

Installing Node.js using Homebrew on Mac OS X:

```
$ brew install node
```

* Python 3
