> ✅ A lightweight and production-ready **RESTful microservice** to manage customer records with full **Docker** and **EKS/Kubernetes** deployment support.

---

## 📚 Table of Contents

- [✨ Features](#-features)
- [🚀 Quick Start](#-quick-start)
