![HUD](screenshots/rollcommand.png)

---

### 🗳️```/startvote``` command, Loot Voting UI
Each item in a vote is shown with buttons:
![Vote Screen](screenshots/screen.png)
![need_hover.png](screenshots/need_hover.png)"
