```plaintext
+------------+      +-------------+      +----------------+
|  CLI / SDK | <--> |    Core     | <--> | Plugin Manager |
+------------+      +-------------+      +----------------+
                          |
                          v
                     +--------+
                     |  APIs  |
                     +--------+
                          |
               +---------------------+
               | External Integrations|
               +---------------------+
```

---

